Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: they crossed the income threshold

asr-000253
00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:17.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: with regards to the poverty line.

asr-000254
00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.820
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Yes, maraming salamat po.

