asr-000455
00:33:14.700 --> 00:33:16.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: compared to last year.

asr-000456
00:33:16.700 --> 00:33:18.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So, we'd like to be enlightened

asr-000457
00:33:18.700 --> 00:33:20.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: how has the department

asr-000458
00:33:20.700 --> 00:33:22.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: pushed forward for the meeting

asr-000459
00:33:22.700 --> 00:33:24.700
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of this target?

asr-000460
