Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Ah, for 2026.

asr-001203
01:18:38.600 --> 01:18:38.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes po.

asr-001204
01:18:39.060 --> 01:18:40.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For 2026, my apologies.

asr-001205
01:18:41.960 --> 01:18:44.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For 2026, what's programmed?

asr-001206
01:18:44.560 --> 01:18:48.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Programmed would be 164.386 billion.

asr-001207
01:18:48.760 --> 01:18:58.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: In total, can DBM confirm that the government expect over 500 billion pesos in SYNTAXES for 2026?

asr-001208
01:19:04.440 --> 01:19:12.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin po, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, higit kalahating trilyong piso ang collection natin sa SYNTAXES.

asr-001209
01:19:12.920 --> 01:19:14.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yes, can DBM confirm?

asr-001210
01:19:14.560 --> 01:19:14.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes po.

asr-001211
01:19:21.440 --> 01:19:30.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, these are programmed though, Madam Speaker, though the actual projections would be better answered by the DOF.

asr-001212
01:19:31.140 --> 01:19:41.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: However, what's programmed for tobacco would be 164 billion and then SSB would be 37.67.

asr-001213
01:19:41.900 --> 01:19:42.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: 67.

asr-001214
01:19:43.440 --> 01:19:43.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: 67.

asr-001215
01:19:44.560 --> 01:19:47.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: To 34.7 billion.

asr-001216
01:19:47.400 --> 01:19:47.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-001217
01:19:48.140 --> 01:20:02.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, that would not be under, yes, yeah, 64 plus 37 would be 201 billion.

asr-001218
01:20:03.780 --> 01:20:05.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: 64 plus 37.

asr-001219
01:20:05.480 --> 01:20:14.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, para po mas madali sa ating kasamang sponsor,

asr-001220
01:20:14.560 --> 01:20:27.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pakitulungan na lang po DBM, i-total ninyo po 142.8 billion, 153.6 billion, at yung 234.7 billion,

asr-001221
01:20:27.900 --> 01:20:32.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: nakapost po ito sa inyong page, sa inyong website.

asr-001222
01:20:33.100 --> 01:20:35.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So, matotal na sa magkano po ang total?

asr-001231
01:20:42.800 --> 01:21:01.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yeah, Madam Speaker, [unclear], at least for 2026, the program would be for SSB 37, and then the tobacco products would be 164. And then, sorry, what was the first item?

asr-001251
01:21:01.900 --> 01:21:17.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ulitin ko po, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor. Yung projected tax collection niyo po from sweetened drinks, nagre-reach po siya ng 142.8 billion for 2026. Tama po ba?

asr-001263
01:21:18.400 --> 01:21:28.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the BSF Table C-3, Madam Speaker, it's only at P37.67 billion.

asr-001264
01:21:28.200 --> 01:21:29.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ito'y for 2026.

asr-001265
01:21:30.200 --> 01:21:32.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For 2026 program, Madam Speaker.

asr-001266
01:21:33.360 --> 01:21:35.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Program, Madam Speaker.

asr-001267
01:21:37.100 --> 01:21:41.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Walang for projected po kasi projected po yung tinitignan natin.

asr-001268
01:21:41.480 --> 01:21:49.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For Table C-3, the projections for 2027.

asr-001269
01:21:51.160 --> 01:21:54.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But the projections for 2026 are those that are programmed.

asr-001270
01:21:56.040 --> 01:21:58.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, at least for Table C-3 of the BSF.

asr-001271
01:22:00.320 --> 01:22:06.160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Magkano naman po ang sa Table C-3 pag ito'y programmed for 2027?

asr-001272
01:22:07.620 --> 01:22:11.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For SSB, this is under C-3.

asr-001273
01:22:11.480 --> 01:22:16.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: C-3 of the BSF, it's P39.669 billion.

asr-001274
01:22:17.080 --> 01:22:28.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And then for tobacco, it would be, for 2027, it's P182.209 billion.

asr-001275
01:22:31.200 --> 01:22:33.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ang for alcohol naman po?

asr-001276
01:22:33.580 --> 01:22:39.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For alcohol, it would be P136.713 billion.

asr-001277
01:22:39.600 --> 01:22:40.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For 2027 projections.

asr-001278
01:22:41.480 --> 01:22:43.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sumatutal na sa magkano po siya?

asr-001279
01:22:44.920 --> 01:22:46.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: P357 billion.

asr-001280
01:22:47.020 --> 01:22:47.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: P200?

asr-001281
01:22:48.580 --> 01:22:51.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Sorry, P357 billion, Madam Speaker.

asr-001282
01:22:51.920 --> 01:22:52.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: P300.

asr-001283
01:22:53.120 --> 01:22:55.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay, P357 billion.

asr-001284
01:22:55.780 --> 01:23:03.960
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin po ba, base sa requirement ng syntax laws at revenues for 2026 mismo ng DBM,

asr-001285
01:23:03.960 --> 01:23:11.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: can DBM confirm that for 2027, the earmark amount for UHC,

asr-001286
01:23:11.480 --> 01:23:16.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: should be around 300 plus billion pesos?

asr-001287
01:23:16.120 --> 01:23:29.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Or at least 60% of the 357 billion?

asr-001303
01:23:44.400 --> 01:23:54.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The basis for this, Madam Speaker, the value I'm going to share would be, based

asr-001304
01:23:54.000 --> 01:24:05.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: on 2025 collections, it would be P310,637,447,000.

asr-001305
01:24:05.460 --> 01:24:10.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So ibig sabihin po, ang naging basis po natin is iyong 2025,

asr-001306
01:24:10.780 --> 01:24:10.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay.

asr-001307
01:24:10.840 --> 01:24:13.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na collections po.

asr-001308
01:24:13.380 --> 01:24:13.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po ba?

asr-001309
01:24:13.920 --> 01:24:15.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For this figure, yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001310
01:24:15.900 --> 01:24:19.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ngayon naman po, can DBM confirm that in the NEP,

asr-001311
01:24:19.760 --> 01:24:23.260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: the allocation for the National Health Insurance Program

asr-001312
01:24:23.260 --> 01:24:26.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: is only P74 billion?

asr-001313
01:24:26.720 --> 01:24:27.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po ba?

asr-001314
01:24:28.060 --> 01:24:29.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001315
01:24:29.780 --> 01:24:32.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano ang basis ng P74 billion?

asr-001316
01:24:32.940 --> 01:24:36.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Magkano po ang P74 billion from the tax revenue

asr-001317
01:24:36.980 --> 01:24:38.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: from sweetened beverages?

asr-001318
01:24:38.940 --> 01:24:42.120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Magkano naman ang sa alcohol products

asr-001319
01:24:42.120 --> 01:24:45.280
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at magkano naman ang sa tobacco products?

asr-001320
01:25:12.500 --> 01:25:38.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, for earmarked revenues for 2027, with regards to the collections from the same taxes,

asr-001322
01:25:38.940 --> 01:25:42.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For tobacco, PhilHealth is supposed to get

asr-001323
01:25:42.120 --> 01:25:46.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: P59.495 billion.

asr-001324
01:25:47.680 --> 01:25:50.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For sugar-sweetened beverages,

asr-001325
01:25:51.240 --> 01:25:58.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it would be P15.731 billion for 2027.

asr-001326
01:26:00.380 --> 01:26:02.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Those are just for PhilHealth.

asr-001327
01:26:02.500 --> 01:26:05.980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: How about po yung sa alcohol products naman po?

asr-001328
01:26:06.140 --> 01:26:06.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Magkano?

asr-001329
01:26:06.580 --> 01:26:08.580
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For alcohol,

asr-001330
01:26:08.940 --> 01:26:09.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-001331
01:26:09.880 --> 01:26:12.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: there is no allocation for PhilHealth.

asr-001332
01:26:13.600 --> 01:26:15.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So matotal na sa magkano po yun?

asr-001333
01:26:18.320 --> 01:26:20.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For universal healthcare,

asr-001334
01:26:20.620 --> 01:26:27.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: would be P75.856 billion for 2027,

asr-001335
01:26:27.140 --> 01:26:27.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the earmarked revenue.

asr-001336
01:26:28.140 --> 01:26:30.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin, ito yung naging basehan

asr-001337
01:26:30.940 --> 01:26:33.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: kaya nagkaroon ng P74 billion.

asr-001338
01:26:33.240 --> 01:26:33.800
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po ba?

asr-001346
01:26:47.600 --> 01:26:50.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, the total for the SYNTAX, for PhilHealth.

asr-001347
01:26:50.820 --> 01:26:55.580
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: That would be the base for the P74 billion.

asr-001348
01:26:55.580 --> 01:26:56.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker.

asr-001349
01:26:56.820 --> 01:26:59.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat Madam Speaker, Madam sponsor.

asr-001350
01:26:59.780 --> 01:27:01.860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Given these figures,

asr-001351
01:27:01.860 --> 01:27:05.700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: can the BM confirm that there is indeed the shortfall

asr-001352
01:27:05.700 --> 01:27:08.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: between the mandated earmarking and the actual

asr-001353
01:27:08.780 --> 01:27:10.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: allocations in the NEP.

asr-001354
01:27:11.460 --> 01:27:12.320
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001355
01:27:13.420 --> 01:27:14.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin po,

asr-001356
01:27:15.120 --> 01:27:16.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: hindi po tayo nagiging

asr-001357
01:27:16.740 --> 01:27:18.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: compliant sa ating batas

asr-001358
01:27:18.740 --> 01:27:20.260
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na syntax. Tama po ba?

asr-001359
01:27:37.300 --> 01:27:37.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-001360
01:27:37.900 --> 01:27:39.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-001361
01:27:40.320 --> 01:27:42.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: This is the perennial challenge.

asr-001362
01:27:42.480 --> 01:27:43.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Unfortunately,

asr-001363
01:27:43.780 --> 01:27:45.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Distinguished Colleague, Honorable Ismula,

asr-001364
01:27:46.260 --> 01:27:48.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: there is

asr-001365
01:27:48.040 --> 01:27:49.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: a chicken-egg

asr-001366
01:27:49.880 --> 01:27:50.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: problem.

asr-001367
01:27:52.180 --> 01:27:53.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Given that

asr-001368
01:27:53.500 --> 01:27:56.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: there has to be a certification

asr-001369
01:27:56.200 --> 01:27:58.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: for the earmarked

asr-001370
01:27:58.300 --> 01:28:00.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: revenues before it can

asr-001371
01:28:00.020 --> 01:28:01.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: be allocated. So,

asr-001372
01:28:02.420 --> 01:28:03.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: usually po nangyayari, hindi na

asr-001373
01:28:03.980 --> 01:28:05.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: hahabol yung certification

asr-001374
01:28:05.720 --> 01:28:07.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: in time for the budgeting.

asr-001375
01:28:07.900 --> 01:28:09.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The planning of the

asr-001376
01:28:09.540 --> 01:28:12.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: program. Kaya, nagkakaroon po

asr-001377
01:28:12.100 --> 01:28:13.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: ng perennial issue na

asr-001378
01:28:13.880 --> 01:28:15.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: yung dapat earmarked revenue

asr-001379
01:28:15.820 --> 01:28:18.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: for particular programs,

asr-001380
01:28:18.340 --> 01:28:19.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: hindi lang po siya sa UHC. Actually,

asr-001381
01:28:21.080 --> 01:28:22.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: lahat po halos

asr-001382
01:28:22.060 --> 01:28:23.680
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: ng ganito po yung problema.

asr-001383
01:28:24.500 --> 01:28:25.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But, rest assured, the DBM

asr-001384
01:28:25.960 --> 01:28:28.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: is trying its best in terms of

asr-001385
01:28:28.080 --> 01:28:30.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: expediting the certifications

asr-001386
01:28:30.180 --> 01:28:31.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and making sure that

asr-001387
01:28:31.860 --> 01:28:33.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: kung ano man ang

asr-001388
01:28:33.440 --> 01:28:35.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: mga programa na kung saan

asr-001389
01:28:35.760 --> 01:28:37.360
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: dapat nakalaanan ng

asr-001390
01:28:37.360 --> 01:28:38.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: ng pondo.

asr-001391
01:28:38.880 --> 01:28:39.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-001392
01:28:41.400 --> 01:28:43.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Laanan talaga nung pondo na yun.

asr-001393
01:28:44.160 --> 01:28:46.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor,

asr-001394
01:28:46.120 --> 01:28:48.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: maraming salamat po. Naintindihan ko po

asr-001395
01:28:48.020 --> 01:28:49.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ito. Pero, gusto ko po

asr-001396
01:28:49.820 --> 01:28:51.560
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: malaman, sino po yung

asr-001397
01:28:51.560 --> 01:28:53.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: nagkulang doon sa certification?

asr-001398
01:29:16.970 --> 01:29:17.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-001399
01:29:18.160 --> 01:29:19.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: On the part of the

asr-001400
01:29:19.460 --> 01:29:19.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: DBM,

asr-001401
01:29:20.480 --> 01:29:23.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: given that the DBM

asr-001402
01:29:23.260 --> 01:29:24.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: only relies on the certification,

asr-001403
01:29:25.280 --> 01:29:26.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the actual issuance of the certification

asr-001404
01:29:26.920 --> 01:29:29.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: with regards to that process,

asr-001405
01:29:29.940 --> 01:29:32.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the DOF would be

asr-001406
01:29:32.040 --> 01:29:32.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: better,

asr-001407
01:29:32.720 --> 01:29:34.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: in the better position to

asr-001408
01:29:34.920 --> 01:29:37.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: speak to that.

asr-001409
01:29:37.360 --> 01:29:39.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: However, the DBM has assured that

asr-001410
01:29:39.180 --> 01:29:41.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it is in constant

asr-001411
01:29:41.800 --> 01:29:43.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: dialogue with the DOF

asr-001412
01:29:43.440 --> 01:29:45.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: to expedite the issuance

asr-001413
01:29:45.480 --> 01:29:47.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: of these certifications para po hindi na nangyayari

asr-001414
01:29:47.600 --> 01:29:48.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: ito kada taon.

asr-001415
01:29:49.640 --> 01:29:50.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker.

asr-001416
01:29:50.600 --> 01:29:53.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor.

asr-001417
01:29:53.660 --> 01:29:55.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Actually, as I understand,

asr-001418
01:29:55.940 --> 01:29:57.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: hindi lamang para sa taong ito

asr-001419
01:29:57.640 --> 01:29:59.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: nangyayari yung ganitong shortfall.

asr-001420
01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:25.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Actually last year ganoon din po. So sana maayos po natin ito kung ano man yung certification na yan nakulang, ano man po yung, or kung sino man yung nagkulang dyan sa certification, sana po mahabol natin dahil pinag-uusapan po natin ang health line ng ating bansa, ang health line ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-001421
01:30:25.620 --> 01:30:40.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi po dapat magiging sagot natin sa health line kung sakali man umabot na yung health line ng isang kababayan natin, ay isasagot natin, pasensya na dahil nagkulang tayo sa certification.

asr-001422
01:30:40.760 --> 01:30:54.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: With that, Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, it's become very obvious that the DBM has not complied with the UHC law and syntax laws in the 2027 budget.

asr-001423
01:30:54.940 --> 01:31:07.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Will DBM commit to submitting a complete accounting to this committee showing all syntax collections versus actual health allocations from 2020 to present?

asr-001424
01:31:08.920 --> 01:31:11.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, the department will comply.

asr-001425
01:31:11.920 --> 01:31:23.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po. At para sa huling katanungan ko po, Madam Sponsor, when Congress corrects this budget and restores the missing billions back to healthcare,

asr-001426
01:31:23.220 --> 01:31:24.920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: will DBM commit?

asr-001427
01:31:24.940 --> 01:31:29.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Will DBM commit to releasing and executing those funds without delay?

asr-001428
01:31:38.920 --> 01:31:44.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As authorized by the GAA, the DBM will comply, Madam Speaker.

asr-001429
01:31:45.820 --> 01:31:53.580
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, linggo-linggo nakikita natin sa social media ang mga hinain ng mga kababayan natin.

asr-001430
01:31:53.580 --> 01:31:58.780
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nadudurog po ang puso ko makita kapag nako-confine ang ating mga kababayan,

asr-001431
01:31:59.400 --> 01:32:03.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: konting-konti lang ang nako-cover ng PhilHealth sa kanilang final bill.

asr-001432
01:32:04.300 --> 01:32:13.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang nangyayari, kukuha sila sa kanilang savings, uutang sila, or iikot sila sa mga ahensya para magmakaawa para sa tulong.

asr-001433
01:32:13.900 --> 01:32:22.020
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang katotohanan pala, may pondo naman palang pwede ilaan para lakihan ang coverage ng PhilHealth kada pasyente,

asr-001434
01:32:22.020 --> 01:32:25.500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: nang hindi kailangan lakihan ang contribution ng members.

asr-001435
01:32:26.120 --> 01:32:31.840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Hindi na kailangang magtiis, mangutang, or manlimos ng mga kababayan natin.

asr-001436
01:32:32.260 --> 01:32:37.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: The government just has to follow the law and fully fund the universal healthcare.

asr-001437
01:32:38.000 --> 01:32:48.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kaya po, I express my strong commitment to address this issue at umaasa ako na kasama ang aking mga colleagues in the 20th Congress.

asr-001438
01:32:48.000 --> 01:32:51.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Mapapalakas natin ang legislation at oversight.

asr-001439
01:32:52.020 --> 01:33:03.520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Para masiguro na ang syntax revenues ay maayos at tapat na nilalaan para wala ng Pilipinong magihirap pa para lang gumaling sa sakit.

asr-001440
01:33:03.960 --> 01:33:15.740
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, may isisingit na lamang po akong katanungan mula sa aking colleague na si Senior Deputy Minority Laila Delima.

asr-001441
01:33:16.600 --> 01:33:20.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Apat lang po isisingit ko dahil may time pa naman ako.

asr-001442
01:33:20.640 --> 01:33:35.040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Yung higher than program disbursements po ba mula fiscal year of 2022 hanggang fiscal year of 2025 ay dahil sa releases galing sa unprogrammed appropriations.

asr-001443
01:33:35.560 --> 01:33:43.820
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin po nito ay mas mataas ang aktual na paggasta kumpara sa orihinal na nakaprogram sa budget.

asr-001444
01:33:44.140 --> 01:33:44.720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tama po ba?

asr-001445
01:33:50.640 --> 01:34:02.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the DBM, this is one factor. Madam Speaker, another factor would be continuing appropriation.

asr-001446
01:34:03.240 --> 01:34:04.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001447
01:34:04.220 --> 01:34:21.300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa 2025 Fiscal Risk Statement ng DBCC, flagged ang UA bilang major risk, dagdag na P118B o 0.66 percentage points sa deficit-to-GDP ratio.

asr-001450
01:34:22.640 --> 01:34:29.640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Pareho na rin ang lumalabas sa independent computation na ginawa ng opisina ni Representative Delima.

asr-001451
01:34:30.400 --> 01:34:41.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Matagal na pong sinasabi na deficit neutral ang UA, pero mismong risk statement ng DBCC nagsasabing deficit inducing ito.

asr-001452
01:34:42.220 --> 01:34:45.760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano ang paliwanag sa contradictions na ito?

asr-001454
01:35:00.400 --> 01:35:05.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, this is driven mostly by loan proceeds disbursement.

asr-001455
01:35:06.400 --> 01:35:10.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As per the DBM, ito po daw yung nalilipat from program to unprogram.

asr-001456
01:35:11.600 --> 01:35:12.500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Salamat po.

asr-001457
01:35:12.500 --> 01:35:20.140
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung mag-materialize ang 0.66% points, ano ang epekto nito sa debt?

asr-001458
01:35:20.640 --> 01:35:24.100
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: GDP path para sa 2027 to 2028.

asr-001464
01:36:16.300 --> 01:36:18.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the estimates of the DBM, Madam Speaker,

asr-001469
01:36:18.900 --> 01:36:30.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For every 30 billion in excess disbursement, it would add 0.1 percentage point in the debt-to-GDP ratio.

asr-001470
01:36:31.580 --> 01:36:33.660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Medyo malaki po 'yun kung suma total.

asr-001471
01:36:34.300 --> 01:36:41.080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, since the DBCC itself flagged the UA as major financial risk,

asr-001472
01:36:41.080 --> 01:36:55.380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: how much in total was released from it from fiscal year of 2022 to fiscal year of 2025 annual figures broken by expense class and implementing agency?

asr-001473
01:36:55.380 --> 01:37:11.060
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung sakali po hindi po available right now, this representation and Representative Laila Delima would be very much willing to receive that copy after this budget.

asr-001474
01:37:11.080 --> 01:37:15.000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Or probably tomorrow po kung ma-provide nila.

asr-001475
01:37:15.560 --> 01:37:15.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-001476
01:37:17.380 --> 01:37:29.700
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And in connection to that, idadagdag po na rin po ito, how much in total was released from the unprogrammed appropriations from fiscal year of 2022 to 2025?

asr-001477
01:37:30.520 --> 01:37:39.460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And can the DBM provide the annual figures and the detailed list of programs, activities, and projects funded by the UA?

asr-001478
01:37:40.340 --> 01:37:40.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-001479
01:37:41.080 --> 01:37:48.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, the DBM will comply with regards to this data from 2022 to 2025.

asr-001480
01:37:49.580 --> 01:37:51.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's quite an extensive list.

asr-001481
01:37:52.560 --> 01:38:00.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But the DBM also mentioned that there were documents submitted to the Committee on Appropriations.

asr-001482
01:38:01.140 --> 01:38:02.220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001483
01:38:02.420 --> 01:38:06.940
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Can Representative Delima in this representation receive the copy as well?

asr-001484
01:38:08.180 --> 01:38:09.220
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-001485
01:38:09.220 --> 01:38:10.240
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001486
01:38:10.240 --> 01:38:28.480
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Speaker, Madam Sponsor, para po sa huling katanungan, can the DBM commit to submit a report through this Committee showing total UA releases against the deficit increases versus original and adjusted programs since fiscal year of 2022?

asr-001487
01:38:33.780 --> 01:38:36.320
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, the Department will comply, Madam Speaker.

asr-001488
01:38:36.740 --> 01:38:37.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po.

asr-001489
01:38:37.620 --> 01:38:39.620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: If the DBM can commit, I ask that...

asr-001490
01:38:40.240 --> 01:38:45.540
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: This representation and the Office of Representative Delima be provided with a copy.

asr-001491
01:38:46.060 --> 01:38:47.600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat, Madam Speaker.

asr-001492
01:38:47.860 --> 01:38:49.900
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Maraming salamat po, Madam Sponsor.

asr-001493
01:38:50.120 --> 01:38:51.340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Thank you, DBM family.

asr-001494
01:38:52.240 --> 01:38:52.960
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Majority Leader.

asr-001495
01:38:55.040 --> 01:39:02.360
Rep. Antonino B. Roman III: Madam Speaker, may we recognize the Honorable Edgar Erize of the 2nd District of Caloocan for his interpellation.

asr-001496
01:39:03.160 --> 01:39:08.660
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Edgar Erize from the 2nd District of Caloocan City is now recognized for his interpellation.

asr-001497
01:39:09.160 --> 01:39:10.040
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Thank you.

asr-001498
01:39:10.240 --> 01:39:13.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker, thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-001499
01:39:15.460 --> 01:39:21.440
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: I'll be going directly to the questions para po mapadali na ang ating pagtulog.

asr-001500
01:39:24.940 --> 01:39:37.420
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Madam Speaker, napakalaki po ng ating mga inuutang at gusto ko pong tanungin sa DEP-DEB kung yung mga ginagastos nating inuutang

asr-001501
01:39:38.360 --> 01:39:40.120
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: ay lumilikha ba ng pangmatagalang

asr-001502
01:39:40.240 --> 01:39:41.380
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: pag-unlad?

asr-001503
01:39:42.960 --> 01:39:49.880
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: O pinapondohan lang natin ang tulong o ayuda na kailangan na naman natin ulitin sa susunod na taon.

asr-001504
01:40:01.060 --> 01:40:07.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, Madam Speaker, Honorable Erize, on the part of DEP-DEB, it's only...

asr-001505
01:40:07.240 --> 01:40:08.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's only...

asr-001506
01:40:08.240 --> 01:40:15.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It formulates policies, it gives recommendations, and it's...

asr-001507
01:40:15.700 --> 01:40:20.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Like the DEP-DEB is in charge of the updating and the crafting of the Philippine Development Plan.

asr-001508
01:40:22.060 --> 01:40:30.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: With regards to that, that's the only purview in which the DEP-DEB can manage these types of investments,

asr-001509
01:40:30.920 --> 01:40:36.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: but it doesn't really have power over the loans contracted.

asr-001510
01:40:37.580 --> 01:40:38.220
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Hindi po ba?

asr-001511
01:40:38.240 --> 01:40:47.800
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Dapat yung pag-gastos natin ng national budget ay aligned with the Philippine Development Plan.

asr-001512
01:40:50.480 --> 01:40:55.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, in terms of financing strategic investments, it will be...

asr-001513
01:40:57.240 --> 01:41:06.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, the financing, the actual financing of the strategic investments in human capital development in all of the sectors

asr-001514
01:41:06.080 --> 01:41:08.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: would be part of the Philippine Development Plan.

asr-001515
01:41:08.100 --> 01:41:16.160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: With regards to the revenue program for those investments, that would not fall under the DEP-DEB's purview.

asr-001516
01:41:17.060 --> 01:41:29.240
Rep. Edgar R. Erice: Wala po ba silang pag-aaral kung yung pong ginagastos ng pamahalaan, yung investment sa mga developmental projects

