02:11:11.140 --> 02:11:14.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, hindi ko na ito pahabain for the interest of time.

asr-002196
02:11:14.280 --> 02:11:16.100
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ayaw kong i-hostage yung mga kasamaan ko.

asr-002197
02:11:16.740 --> 02:11:19.140
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, hindi ko na ituloy.

asr-002198
02:11:19.660 --> 02:11:28.440
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, sawa na po ako sa 7 taon na yung mga agency, patapusin lang nila yung oras ng interpelator.

asr-002199
02:11:29.200 --> 02:11:31.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Naghihintay kami, naghihintay yung asawa ko.

asr-002200
02:11:32.040 --> 02:11:35.380
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos, nakajakit na nga, nakamaro, nakaano pa.

asr-002201
02:11:35.840 --> 02:11:37.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tapos, wala namang mangyari.

asr-002202
02:11:37.600 --> 02:11:39.820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Pagkatapos, ay anyway, approved naman nila yun.

asr-002203
02:11:40.120 --> 02:11:40.260
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sige, hindi ko na ituloy.

asr-002204
02:11:40.280 --> 02:11:41.760
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: I've been years na ako sa ganito.

asr-002205
02:11:42.360 --> 02:11:48.180
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Alam ng mga tao dito sa roles na hindi ako umalis dito habang ano.

asr-002206
02:11:48.680 --> 02:11:53.580
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, it is unacceptable for me na gani-ganito na lang.

asr-002207
02:11:54.200 --> 02:12:00.000
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kasi, napakalaki ang impact na dita na ito sa ating desisyon sa pag-budget.

asr-002208
02:12:00.340 --> 02:12:01.820
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Sa rekomendasyon ng dip-dip.

asr-002209
02:12:02.220 --> 02:12:08.060
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Kaya, you are created by law para magbigay ng rekomendasyon.

asr-002210
02:12:08.060 --> 02:12:10.160
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: At alam ko, dita yung ginagawa.

asr-002211
02:12:10.280 --> 02:12:15.800
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Nagamit ninyo sa pag-evaluate kung ano yung i-recommend nyo.

asr-002212
02:12:16.320 --> 02:12:19.920
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Ngayon, kung mali yung dita, garbage in, garbage out nga.

asr-002213
02:12:20.500 --> 02:12:24.240
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: So, I will not prolong the agony of others.

asr-002214
02:12:25.940 --> 02:12:30.300
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Tatapusin ko na yung interpellation ko sa dip-dip.

asr-002215
02:12:31.940 --> 02:12:34.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Including yung PSA.

asr-002216
02:12:35.540 --> 02:12:36.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Mamaya na lang.

asr-002217
02:12:37.200 --> 02:12:38.480
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-002218
02:12:38.480 --> 02:12:39.600
Rep. Sergio C. Dagooc: Thank you, Distinguished Sponsor.

asr-002219
02:12:41.180 --> 02:12:42.160
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: [unclear] Leader.

asr-002220
02:12:43.220 --> 02:12:49.600
Rep. Brian Poe: Madam Speaker, we'd like to now call upon Representative Robert Nazal of BH Party List for his interpellation.

asr-002221
02:12:51.940 --> 02:12:56.980
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Robert Nazal of BH Party List is now recognized for his interpellation.

asr-002222
02:13:07.040 --> 02:13:09.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, just to clarify, this is for DBM already.

asr-002223
02:13:10.280 --> 02:13:26.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I'll go right to my questions

asr-002224
02:13:26.600 --> 02:13:28.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair

asr-002225
02:13:28.400 --> 02:13:30.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hold muna

asr-002226
02:13:30.900 --> 02:13:35.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Paki suspend yung time

asr-002227
02:13:40.280 --> 02:13:43.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair

asr-002228
02:13:43.720 --> 02:13:46.100
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Chair would like to request our

asr-002229
02:13:46.100 --> 02:13:48.000
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Technical Committee

asr-002230
02:13:48.000 --> 02:13:50.400
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: to please suspend the time or return it to zero

asr-002231
02:13:50.400 --> 02:13:51.420
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: since the

asr-002232
02:13:51.420 --> 02:13:54.140
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Nassal has not yet started

asr-002233
02:13:54.140 --> 02:13:55.020
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: asking questions

asr-002234
02:13:55.020 --> 02:13:57.400
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Please stop the time

asr-002235
02:13:57.400 --> 02:13:59.500
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: You may proceed

asr-002236
02:13:59.500 --> 02:14:01.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you Madam Chair

asr-002237
02:14:01.620 --> 02:14:05.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Distinguished colleague

asr-002238
02:14:05.180 --> 02:14:06.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So for DBM

asr-002239
02:14:06.780 --> 02:14:10.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Gusto ko lang pong balikan yung

asr-002240
02:14:10.140 --> 02:14:12.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: pinakel natin kanina

asr-002241
02:14:12.420 --> 02:14:14.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair

asr-002242
02:14:14.720 --> 02:14:17.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam

asr-002243
02:14:17.000 --> 02:14:18.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Distinguished colleague

asr-002244
02:14:18.840 --> 02:14:21.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I just would like to express

asr-002245
02:14:21.340 --> 02:14:21.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: na

asr-002246
02:14:21.960 --> 02:14:26.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tama po ba

asr-002247
02:14:26.920 --> 02:14:29.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: that you cannot suspend an expenditure

asr-002248
02:14:29.420 --> 02:14:31.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: under Section 38

asr-002249
02:14:31.420 --> 02:14:32.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: when there is no SARO

asr-002250
02:14:32.640 --> 02:14:34.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: or allotment yet

asr-002251
02:14:34.100 --> 02:14:36.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So I would just like to clear that up

asr-002252
02:14:36.300 --> 02:14:39.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Minabalikan ko lang po yung pinag-usapan kanina

asr-002253
02:14:40.140 --> 02:14:48.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yung sa Section 38 po

asr-002254
02:14:48.520 --> 02:14:51.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: yung suspension of expenditure of appropriations

asr-002255
02:14:51.100 --> 02:14:53.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: except as otherwise provided

asr-002256
02:14:53.260 --> 02:14:54.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: in the General Appropriations Act

asr-002257
02:14:54.960 --> 02:14:57.440
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and whenever in his judgment

asr-002258
02:14:57.440 --> 02:14:59.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: the public interest so requires

asr-002259
02:14:59.700 --> 02:15:00.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: the President

asr-002265
02:15:00.000 --> 02:15:17.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Upon notice to the head of the office concerned, it is authorized to suspend or otherwise stop further expenditure of funds allotted for the agency or any other expenditure authorized in the GAA except for personal services, appropriations used for permanent officials and employees.

asr-002266
02:15:20.060 --> 02:15:21.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So kinaklarify ko lang po.

asr-002267
02:15:25.800 --> 02:15:27.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Please suspend my time.

asr-002268
02:15:30.000 --> 02:15:32.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pakitigilan po.

asr-002269
02:15:33.560 --> 02:15:33.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you.

asr-002270
02:15:40.000 --> 02:15:41.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002271
02:15:42.860 --> 02:15:49.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: We can suspend appropriations without initial allotment.

asr-002272
02:15:52.820 --> 02:15:54.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bawal po sa Arawlio.

asr-002273
02:15:54.840 --> 02:15:55.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Very clear po yun.

asr-002274
02:15:58.200 --> 02:15:59.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: You cannot suspend.

asr-002275
02:15:59.880 --> 02:15:59.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano?

asr-002276
02:16:00.000 --> 02:16:10.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang tinatanong ko po, kinaklarify ko, you cannot suspend an expenditure under Section 38 when there is no SARO or allotment yet.

asr-002277
02:16:12.600 --> 02:16:13.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes or no?

asr-002278
02:16:22.800 --> 02:16:23.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Time please.

asr-002279
02:16:25.880 --> 02:16:26.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-002280
02:16:26.940 --> 02:16:27.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-002281
02:16:27.380 --> 02:16:29.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-002282
02:16:30.000 --> 02:16:46.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The particular provision or the particular paragraph that the Honorable Nazal is referring to, according to the DBM, is not part of the actual decision of the Supreme Court.

asr-002283
02:16:46.640 --> 02:16:47.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's part of a separate opinion.

asr-002284
02:16:49.600 --> 02:16:59.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Nandun po sa Section 38 nung EO 292 Administrative Code of 1987, Book 6, Chapter 5.

asr-002285
02:17:00.000 --> 02:17:01.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Section 38.

asr-002286
02:17:01.780 --> 02:17:04.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Suspension of expenditure of appropriations.

asr-002287
02:17:04.400 --> 02:17:05.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It's very specific.

asr-002288
02:17:06.900 --> 02:17:15.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang sinasabi po doon, you cannot suspend an expenditure without allotment.

asr-002289
02:17:17.500 --> 02:17:19.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So I just want us to agree.

asr-002290
02:17:26.880 --> 02:17:28.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: My time please.

asr-002296
02:18:28.500 --> 02:18:34.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi kung sinasabi niyo po na hindi na?

asr-002297
02:18:38.500 --> 02:19:10.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, if I am allowed? Oh, sorry. Madam Speaker, if I will be allowed to read the particular paragraph as relevant to the question of the Honorable Nazal. In contrast, the respondents emphasized that NBC No. 541 adopted a spending, not saving, policy as a last-ditch effort of the executive to push agencies into actually spending their appropriations.

asr-002298
02:19:11.600 --> 02:19:27.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: That such policy did not amount to an impoundment scheme because impoundment referred to the decision of the executive to refuse to spend funds for political or ideological reasons.

asr-002299
02:19:27.560 --> 02:19:29.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And that the withdrawal of…

asr-002300
02:19:29.740 --> 02:19:41.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The withdrawal of allotments under NBC No. 541 was made pursuant to Section 38, Chapter 5, Book 6 of the Administrative Code,

asr-002301
02:19:42.340 --> 02:19:53.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: by which the President was granted the authority to suspend or otherwise stop further expenditure of funds allotted to any agency.

asr-002302
02:19:53.260 --> 02:19:59.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Twice, Madam Chair and Distinguished Colleague, twice you mentioned allotment.

asr-002303
02:19:59.740 --> 02:20:01.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Allotted, allotment.

asr-002304
02:20:01.540 --> 02:20:08.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ang tinatanong ko lang po is, ang pwede lang po ba i-suspend ay yung allotted?

asr-002305
02:20:13.060 --> 02:20:13.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes or no?

asr-002306
02:20:16.220 --> 02:20:20.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Nakalagay po yung sinabi niyo doon sa NBC, allotment, allotted.

asr-002307
02:20:22.240 --> 02:20:24.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, pag hindi allotted, pwede ba i-suspend?

asr-002308
02:20:27.860 --> 02:20:28.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes or no?

asr-002309
02:20:29.740 --> 02:20:42.160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, as for the DBM, we can suspend for both locations and allotment.

asr-002310
02:20:42.160 --> 02:20:47.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Were there already suspended na hindi allotted?

asr-002311
02:20:49.780 --> 02:20:52.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Meron na po tayo mga sinuspend na hindi allotted?

asr-002312
02:20:52.380 --> 02:20:54.460
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes.

asr-002313
02:20:59.740 --> 02:21:05.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The DBM has not invoked Section 38 as of today.

asr-002314
02:21:05.180 --> 02:21:06.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sorry, I cannot hear you.

asr-002315
02:21:06.340 --> 02:21:06.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker.

asr-002316
02:21:07.200 --> 02:21:10.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you please speak again, again? Sorry.

asr-002317
02:21:10.900 --> 02:21:14.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The DBM has not invoked Section 38 as of today.

asr-002318
02:21:14.600 --> 02:21:18.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: They have not invoked Section 38. So, wala pa tayo na sususpend na hindi allotted?

asr-002319
02:21:20.120 --> 02:21:23.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Wala pa tayo na sususpend na allotted either?

asr-002320
02:21:23.420 --> 02:21:28.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The DBM has not suspended either the allotment or the appropriation.

asr-002322
02:21:33.940 --> 02:21:34.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As of today.

asr-002323
02:21:34.500 --> 02:21:37.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But are you saying that you can suspend even if it's not allotted?

asr-002324
02:21:44.540 --> 02:21:46.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002325
02:21:46.420 --> 02:21:47.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That is what you're saying.

asr-002326
02:21:47.800 --> 02:21:51.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: You have to really take a look at that kasi bawal po yun.

asr-002327
02:21:52.260 --> 02:21:54.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Expressly stated yan doon sa administrative code.

asr-002328
02:21:57.180 --> 02:21:59.680
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, but the DBM assures that it has not...

asr-002329
02:21:59.740 --> 02:22:03.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It has not done any suspension with regards to both appropriations and allotment.

asr-002330
02:22:03.740 --> 02:22:12.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I respectfully disagree po na pwede po tayo mag-suspend ng hindi allotted.

asr-002331
02:22:13.300 --> 02:22:17.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: The Supreme Court in Araulio v. Aquino was categorical.

asr-002332
02:22:17.920 --> 02:22:23.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: The President cannot exercise the power to suspend or stop expenditure under Section 38

asr-002333
02:22:23.900 --> 02:22:29.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: towards appropriations as funds for it have yet to be released and allotted.

asr-002334
02:22:29.740 --> 02:22:36.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And that is very specifically stated doon po sa Araulio v. Aquino.

asr-002335
02:22:36.400 --> 02:22:39.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: This is what you're saying.

asr-002336
02:22:40.160 --> 02:22:40.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-002337
02:22:41.820 --> 02:22:44.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Just to reiterate, Madam Speaker,

asr-002338
02:22:44.780 --> 02:22:49.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: that particular provision that the Honorable Nazales is referring to

asr-002339
02:22:49.860 --> 02:22:51.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: is a part of a separate opinion.

asr-002340
02:22:51.960 --> 02:22:53.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's not part of the decision of the Supreme Court.

asr-002341
02:22:53.400 --> 02:22:55.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: No, that is part of the Supreme Court decision.

asr-002342
02:22:55.340 --> 02:22:56.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It is very specific.

asr-002343
02:22:57.860 --> 02:22:59.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It is stated exactly...

asr-002344
02:22:59.740 --> 02:23:00.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Exactly in the decision.

asr-002345
02:23:03.600 --> 02:23:04.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kahit...

asr-002346
02:23:04.360 --> 02:23:06.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And even if you go back to Section 38,

asr-002347
02:23:08.580 --> 02:23:12.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: basahin niyo po yung Section 38 nung National...

asr-002348
02:23:12.020 --> 02:23:15.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: nung Book 6, nung Administrative Code of 1987.

asr-002349
02:23:16.400 --> 02:23:16.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Nandun po.

asr-002350
02:23:18.060 --> 02:23:18.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi pwede.

asr-002351
02:23:21.960 --> 02:23:26.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, as for the filists of the DBM,

asr-002352
02:23:28.120 --> 02:23:29.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it's a part of a separate opinion.

asr-002353
02:23:29.740 --> 02:23:32.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's a part of a separate opinion by Justice Biron.

asr-002354
02:23:33.140 --> 02:23:37.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So it's not part of the decision of the Supreme Court.

asr-002355
02:23:37.520 --> 02:23:39.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for DBM files.

asr-002356
02:23:44.100 --> 02:23:44.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: You have...

asr-002357
02:23:44.820 --> 02:23:45.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tignan na lang po natin.

asr-002358
02:23:46.020 --> 02:23:48.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I will also show you the specific provision cited

asr-002359
02:23:48.780 --> 02:23:50.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: based on the decision.

asr-002360
02:23:53.700 --> 02:23:57.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Anyway, my next question is...

asr-002361
02:23:57.740 --> 02:23:59.460
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Nagkakaintindihan po tayo

asr-002365
02:23:59.740 --> 02:24:02.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That suspension is temporary.

asr-002366
02:24:05.300 --> 02:24:07.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So a merely suspended project

asr-002367
02:24:07.640 --> 02:24:09.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: cannot be treated as savings.

asr-002368
02:24:09.880 --> 02:24:10.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tama po ba?

asr-002369
02:24:10.740 --> 02:24:11.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002370
02:24:13.040 --> 02:24:15.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It can qualify as savings only

asr-002371
02:24:15.400 --> 02:24:17.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: when the applicable GAA requirements

asr-002372
02:24:17.260 --> 02:24:18.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: are independently satisfied.

asr-002373
02:24:19.760 --> 02:24:21.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For example, completion,

asr-002374
02:24:22.020 --> 02:24:23.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: final discontinuance or abandonment,

asr-002375
02:24:24.820 --> 02:24:27.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: or balances resulting from efficiency measures.

asr-002376
02:24:27.480 --> 02:24:27.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Correct?

asr-002377
02:24:29.740 --> 02:24:36.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Final discontinuance, abandonment.

asr-002378
02:24:36.420 --> 02:24:37.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002379
02:24:38.580 --> 02:24:40.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So hindi pwedeng suspended lang ang project

asr-002380
02:24:40.720 --> 02:24:42.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: pero savings na agad ang pera.

asr-002381
02:24:43.600 --> 02:24:44.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tama po.

asr-002382
02:24:46.340 --> 02:24:50.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for DBM, those are two different matters, Madam Speaker.

asr-002383
02:24:51.120 --> 02:24:53.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: No, no. That is not a different matter.

asr-002384
02:24:53.480 --> 02:24:54.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: I am just asking

asr-002385
02:24:54.480 --> 02:24:55.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: if

asr-002386
02:24:55.860 --> 02:24:58.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: we suspend some...

asr-002387
02:24:58.800 --> 02:24:59.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pagka meron tayong...

asr-002388
02:24:59.740 --> 02:25:00.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: sinuspend na project,

asr-002389
02:25:01.320 --> 02:25:03.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: hindi ito automatically treated as savings.

asr-002390
02:25:03.900 --> 02:25:04.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tama?

asr-002391
02:25:04.060 --> 02:25:10.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002392
02:25:10.780 --> 02:25:12.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's not automatic that

asr-002393
02:25:12.100 --> 02:25:14.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: if we suspend, it's automatically saved.

asr-002394
02:25:14.820 --> 02:25:16.120
