Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: is required to submit

asr-002412
02:26:10.780 --> 02:26:12.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: a certification that

asr-002413
02:26:12.640 --> 02:26:15.360
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the following

asr-002414
02:26:15.360 --> 02:26:17.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: requirements are

asr-002415
02:26:17.960 --> 02:26:19.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: complied with.

asr-002416
02:26:19.740 --> 02:26:20.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, completion,

asr-002417
02:26:21.480 --> 02:26:22.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: final discontinuance,

asr-002418
02:26:23.020 --> 02:26:24.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: or abandonment of a program activity

asr-002419
02:26:24.800 --> 02:26:27.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: or project for which the appropriation

asr-002420
02:26:27.000 --> 02:26:27.800
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: is authorized,

asr-002421
02:26:27.800 --> 02:26:32.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: or the implementation of measures

asr-002422
02:26:32.760 --> 02:26:34.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: resulting in improved systems

asr-002423
02:26:34.820 --> 02:26:35.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and efficiencies.

asr-002424
02:26:36.220 --> 02:26:37.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, we have a project level,

asr-002425
02:26:38.040 --> 02:26:40.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair, certification

asr-002426
02:26:40.300 --> 02:26:41.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: showing the specific

asr-002427
02:26:41.900 --> 02:26:43.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: legal ground.

asr-002428
02:26:44.360 --> 02:26:45.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002429
02:26:46.200 --> 02:26:47.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Per project po yan?

asr-002430
02:26:48.120 --> 02:26:49.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Per project, yes.

asr-002431
02:26:49.200 --> 02:26:50.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And can we get a copy?

asr-002432
02:26:52.380 --> 02:26:53.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: A copy.

asr-002433
02:26:53.040 --> 02:26:53.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Okay.

asr-002435
02:26:57.800 --> 02:27:02.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, the DBM commits

asr-002436
02:27:02.700 --> 02:27:03.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: to submitting.

asr-002437
02:27:04.140 --> 02:27:06.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Distinguished Colleague, Madam Chair.

