Rep. Roberto Nazal: My next question is,

asr-002439
02:27:09.080 --> 02:27:09.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Madam Chair,

asr-002440
02:27:10.180 --> 02:27:11.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: nung unang hearing

asr-002441
02:27:11.080 --> 02:27:13.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: with the DBM, dun sa ating

asr-002442
02:27:13.720 --> 02:27:16.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: DBM briefing,

asr-002443
02:27:18.840 --> 02:27:19.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: nakala natin

asr-002444
02:27:19.620 --> 02:27:22.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: nasa DPWH pa ang problema.

asr-002445
02:27:23.920 --> 02:27:24.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ngayon, sinabi ng

asr-002446
02:27:24.860 --> 02:27:26.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: DPWH nung kanilang briefing

asr-002447
02:27:26.800 --> 02:27:27.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: na binalik na siya,

asr-002448
02:27:27.660 --> 02:27:28.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: binalik na sa DBM

asr-002449
02:27:28.820 --> 02:27:30.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: yung mga SARO

asr-002450
02:27:30.580 --> 02:27:32.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: nung September 2025.

asr-002451
02:27:33.720 --> 02:27:35.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kahit March 2025 pa lamang

asr-002452
02:27:35.760 --> 02:27:37.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: na-issue ang mga SARO.

asr-002453
02:27:38.540 --> 02:27:39.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Meaning, these projects

asr-002454
02:27:39.740 --> 02:27:41.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: had already passed

asr-002455
02:27:41.040 --> 02:27:42.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: NBC 595.

asr-002456
02:27:44.380 --> 02:27:45.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can DBM confirm this?

asr-002457
02:27:49.360 --> 02:27:50.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And natanggap nyo ba

asr-002458
02:27:50.520 --> 02:27:52.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: yung mga ibinalik na SARO?

asr-002459
02:27:57.660 --> 02:28:02.420
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Just to clarify, Madam Speaker,

asr-002460
02:28:02.420 --> 02:28:03.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: September 2025?

asr-002461
02:28:03.940 --> 02:28:05.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: September 2026?

asr-002462
02:28:05.460 --> 02:28:07.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes, because during the hearing

asr-002463
02:28:07.200 --> 02:28:08.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: with DPWH,

asr-002464
02:28:08.640 --> 02:28:10.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ang sabi po ng DPWH,

asr-002465
02:28:10.080 --> 02:28:11.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: binalik nila

asr-002466
02:28:11.500 --> 02:28:13.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: yung mga SARO sa inyo.

asr-002467
02:28:13.500 --> 02:28:15.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And meron po silang report

asr-002468
02:28:15.620 --> 02:28:17.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ng negative SARO.

asr-002469
02:28:18.620 --> 02:28:20.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the DBM,

asr-002470
02:28:20.920 --> 02:28:22.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker,

asr-002471
02:28:22.920 --> 02:28:24.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: no certifications have been

asr-002472
02:28:24.920 --> 02:28:26.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: issued.

asr-002473
02:28:26.920 --> 02:28:47.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So are you telling me Madam Chair, Distinguished Colleague na nagsisinungaling po yung DPWH dun sa sinabi nilang report na meron po silang report ng mga SARO na binalik sa inyo na meron silang negative SARO na galing sa inyo?

asr-002474
02:28:56.920 --> 02:29:02.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May time please.

asr-002475
02:29:26.920 --> 02:29:44.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, at least on the part of the DBM, it's not able to issue a negative SARO yet given that no purpose has been established at the time.

asr-002476
02:29:44.140 --> 02:29:56.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So given that the supposed certifications were made in September 2025 and then the circular was issued,

asr-002477
02:29:56.920 --> 02:29:59.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it was issued in April 2026.

asr-002478
02:30:00.000 --> 02:30:08.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, there's a disconnect in terms of the periods, Madam Speaker.

asr-002479
02:30:09.520 --> 02:30:14.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano pong sabi niyo? Can you please repeat? You said September 2026?

asr-002480
02:30:14.640 --> 02:30:15.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: September 2025.

asr-002481
02:30:17.120 --> 02:30:19.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That was the report of the DPWH.

asr-002482
02:30:19.740 --> 02:30:28.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: They reported that in September of 2025, minalik na po nila ang mga saraw.

asr-002483
02:30:30.000 --> 02:30:32.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And this was an order made by the President.

asr-002484
02:30:35.180 --> 02:30:40.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes. Well, with indulgence of our good colleague, Honorable Nazal,

asr-002485
02:30:41.280 --> 02:30:45.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the DBM is going to submit the list of the certifications anyway.

asr-002486
02:30:45.500 --> 02:30:50.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, maybe that way, it would verify whichever...

asr-002487
02:30:51.940 --> 02:30:56.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Anyway, are there saraw that were returned in 2025 by DPWH?

asr-002488
02:31:00.000 --> 02:31:08.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi, I may be mistaken by the date, pero are there any saraw?

asr-002489
02:31:08.780 --> 02:31:08.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes.

asr-002490
02:31:13.120 --> 02:31:22.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For 2025, it's, according to the DBM, it's at least, as of August of 2026, this would be the figure,

asr-002491
02:31:22.280 --> 02:31:29.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: 20 billion, 59 million, 488 million, 612 thousand.

asr-002492
02:31:30.000 --> 02:31:38.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ang sinasabi po ninyo, walang binalik na saraw ng 2025 ang DPWH.

asr-002493
02:31:51.080 --> 02:31:54.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Wala pa daw po, Madam Speaker. As for the DBM?

asr-002494
02:31:54.900 --> 02:31:54.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the DBM?

asr-002495
02:32:00.000 --> 02:32:09.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, there is a disconnect between what you're saying and what was reported during the briefing of DPWH.

asr-002496
02:32:14.340 --> 02:32:23.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes. The DBM will supplement this information by submitting the proper documents, Madam Speaker.

asr-002497
02:32:24.520 --> 02:32:29.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But in 2026, meron pong mga saraw na binalik?

asr-002498
02:32:29.080 --> 02:32:42.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, wala.

asr-002499
02:32:45.560 --> 02:32:46.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: None.

asr-002500
02:32:47.260 --> 02:32:51.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: None specifically for DPWH, as of, for the 2026 projects.

asr-002501
02:32:52.400 --> 02:32:53.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For other departments?

asr-002502
02:32:53.260 --> 02:32:53.460
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For other departments.

asr-002503
02:32:59.080 --> 02:33:01.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For the other departments, Madam Speaker, yes.

asr-002504
02:33:02.220 --> 02:33:06.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: There have been, there should have been a return.

asr-002505
02:33:08.640 --> 02:33:09.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Okay.

asr-002506
02:33:11.280 --> 02:33:13.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, these are various agencies.

asr-002507
02:33:13.840 --> 02:33:16.740
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, I'll just start alphabetically.

asr-002508
02:33:16.920 --> 02:33:22.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The Department of Agriculture, 742 billion.

asr-002509
02:33:22.760 --> 02:33:23.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Okay lang.

asr-002510
02:33:23.900 --> 02:33:26.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: How about the continuing for 2025?

asr-002511
02:33:26.180 --> 02:33:27.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Million. I'm so sorry. Million.

asr-002512
02:33:28.060 --> 02:33:28.960
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yung continuing po.

asr-002513
02:33:29.080 --> 02:33:30.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: For 2025.

asr-002514
02:33:32.080 --> 02:33:33.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And DPWH.

asr-002515
02:33:43.160 --> 02:33:43.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: My time, please.

asr-002516
02:33:45.400 --> 02:33:50.680
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, for the continuing for 2025, this 2025.

asr-002517
02:33:54.460 --> 02:33:54.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-002518
02:33:54.900 --> 02:33:57.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's 20 billion,

asr-002522
02:33:57.400 --> 02:34:00.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: 59,488,612.

asr-002523
02:34:00.840 --> 02:34:03.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Which was offered in 2026.

asr-002524
02:34:06.420 --> 02:34:08.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Suspended?

asr-002525
02:34:09.020 --> 02:34:11.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What was the basis?

asr-002526
02:34:12.020 --> 02:34:14.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It...

asr-002527
02:34:14.940 --> 02:34:19.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: final discontinuance.

asr-002529
02:34:24.760 --> 02:34:27.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ...

asr-002530
02:34:28.620 --> 02:34:39.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, the basis for, it goes to savings,

asr-002531
02:34:39.600 --> 02:34:46.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it's 20,059,488,612.

asr-002532
02:34:47.100 --> 02:34:48.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's a mix of all.

asr-002533
02:34:48.660 --> 02:34:50.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's a combination of all of the different grounds,

asr-002534
02:34:50.900 --> 02:34:53.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: so completion, final discontinuance, abandonment.

asr-002535
02:34:56.020 --> 02:34:56.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Discontinuance.

asr-002536
02:34:56.880 --> 02:34:58.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Improved systems and efficiency.

asr-002537
02:34:58.620 --> 02:35:02.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: May we have per project?

asr-002538
02:35:06.060 --> 02:35:08.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yeah, for all projects, Madam Speaker.

asr-002539
02:35:08.480 --> 02:35:09.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, the DBM will comply.

asr-002540
02:35:10.240 --> 02:35:13.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, what was the basis for declaring it a savings?

asr-002541
02:35:15.980 --> 02:35:18.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's the agency certification.

asr-002542
02:35:19.260 --> 02:35:20.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, the agency head has a certification.

asr-002543
02:35:20.940 --> 02:35:26.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: An agency certification indicating that all these projects were discontinued or abandoned?

asr-002544
02:35:28.620 --> 02:35:35.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, they should have if they were discontinued or they got reverted to savings.

asr-002545
02:35:35.900 --> 02:35:36.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And you have that document?

asr-002546
02:35:40.460 --> 02:35:44.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's a voluminous set of documents.

asr-002547
02:35:44.520 --> 02:35:46.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, it's a project by project.

asr-002548
02:35:46.480 --> 02:35:48.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's a line by line of all projects.

asr-002549
02:35:48.520 --> 02:35:53.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But the DBM has it on file and will send either a hard copy or a soft copy.

asr-002550
02:35:54.260 --> 02:35:54.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Did you verify?

asr-002551
02:35:54.920 --> 02:35:56.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Did you verify?

asr-002552
02:35:56.300 --> 02:35:57.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Did you verify that the projects were?

asr-002553
02:35:57.980 --> 02:36:07.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Actually, qualified under the NBC 603 and the rules for savings?

asr-002554
02:36:12.140 --> 02:36:20.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It would be the certification of the head of the agency,

asr-002555
02:36:21.140 --> 02:36:27.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: which would assure that it would fall in any of these categories, Madam Speaker.

asr-002556
02:36:27.100 --> 02:36:27.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Okay.

asr-002557
02:36:27.980 --> 02:36:30.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kung i-certify po nila, hindi nyo na kailangan i-validate?

asr-002558
02:36:34.600 --> 02:36:35.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, yes.

asr-002559
02:36:35.820 --> 02:36:38.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the DBM, it would fall.

asr-002560
02:36:38.260 --> 02:36:42.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The responsibility of the certification would fall with the agency head.

asr-002561
02:36:44.840 --> 02:36:48.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pero shouldn't we at least validate?

asr-002562
02:36:50.180 --> 02:36:56.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi, paano natin malalaman kung talagang nag-fall under the provision for savings?

asr-002563
02:36:57.980 --> 02:37:04.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And how do we now make sure na hindi ito manufactured savings?

asr-002564
02:37:04.300 --> 02:37:27.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, at least on the part of the DBM, the current status quo is that the DBM just verifies with the status of obligation in the financial reports for the particular projects.

asr-002565
02:37:27.660 --> 02:37:28.900
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Let me give you an example.

asr-002566
02:37:29.960 --> 02:37:32.420
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Meron po tayo mga sinuspend na project.

asr-002567
02:37:33.080 --> 02:37:35.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Katulad ng multi-purpose building, halimbawa.

asr-002568
02:37:35.760 --> 02:37:39.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yun ang nakalagay dun sa project description or line item.

asr-002569
02:37:40.020 --> 02:37:45.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tapos, kasama siya dun sa sinuspend natin and then eventually ginawa nating saving.

asr-002570
02:37:46.800 --> 02:37:53.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ano ang dahilan para isama natin yung para maging discontinued or

asr-002571
02:37:53.880 --> 02:37:54.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: um,

asr-002572
02:37:54.280 --> 02:38:01.340
Rep. Roberto Nazal: para ma-discontinue yung katulad nung project na yun habang na-bid out yun.

asr-002573
02:38:02.580 --> 02:38:03.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tapos,

asr-002574
02:38:05.940 --> 02:38:07.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: short of award, na-bid out siya.

asr-002575
02:38:14.700 --> 02:38:19.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: With that particular situation, Madam Speaker,

asr-002576
02:38:20.100 --> 02:38:24.260
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: well, the DBM has not, again, has not invoked the suspension.

asr-002577
02:38:24.280 --> 02:38:26.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Under Section 38.

asr-002578
02:38:27.420 --> 02:38:30.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But, at least with that, probably what happened was that

asr-002579
02:38:30.760 --> 02:38:34.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the head of the agency gave the certification that it's,

asr-002580
02:38:35.220 --> 02:38:38.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it falls within these conditions.

asr-002581
02:38:39.260 --> 02:38:45.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But, but, but isn't it also the obligation of DBM to make sure that

asr-002582
02:38:45.700 --> 02:38:52.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ito pong rules natin for declaring savings is being followed?

asr-002583
02:38:54.280 --> 02:39:00.660
Rep. Roberto Nazal: If hindi po natin i-validate, then we can just manufacture savings.

asr-002584
02:39:01.540 --> 02:39:08.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And it will be very convenient para sa inyo, nagagamitin niyo yung pondo.

asr-002585
02:39:10.860 --> 02:39:13.000
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kaya hindi na lang natin iti-check.

asr-002586
02:39:18.460 --> 02:39:22.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: For the information of the Honorable Nazal, Madam Speaker,

asr-002587
02:39:22.860 --> 02:39:28.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the basis for that, for relying on the certification of the heads of agencies,

asr-002588
02:39:28.620 --> 02:39:33.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: particularly with the discontinuance and all of that,

asr-002589
02:39:33.620 --> 02:39:42.580
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: is that they have that mandate under EO 219 as of now.

asr-002590
02:39:43.720 --> 02:39:49.680
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, that's the reason why we're relying on the certifications by the heads of agencies.

asr-002591
02:39:50.200 --> 02:39:52.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But, but I thought, as you mentioned,

asr-002592
02:39:52.860 --> 02:39:58.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: earlier, hindi pa natin ini-invoke yung Section 38.

asr-002593
02:39:59.620 --> 02:40:05.060
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yeah, no. This is Section 51, Chapter 9, Subtitle B, Title 1.

asr-002594
02:40:05.160 --> 02:40:05.940
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, it's a different section.

asr-002595
02:40:07.060 --> 02:40:10.000
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: This is particularly for the certification of,

asr-002596
02:40:10.720 --> 02:40:15.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: by the heads of agencies regarding the final discontinuance continuation

asr-002597
02:40:15.440 --> 02:40:17.100
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: that would revert it back to savings.

asr-002598
02:40:17.100 --> 02:40:21.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, you're saying, Madam Chair, Madam Sponsor,

asr-002599
02:40:21.840 --> 02:40:22.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: that DPWA,

asr-002600
02:40:22.860 --> 02:40:29.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: with the head of the agency,

asr-002601
02:40:29.400 --> 02:40:31.020
Rep. Roberto Nazal: can just identify projects,

asr-002602
02:40:32.280 --> 02:40:34.760
Rep. Roberto Nazal: sabihin na ito ay discontinued,

asr-002603
02:40:34.940 --> 02:40:36.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: at hindi na natin malalaman kung totoo ito.

asr-002604
02:40:38.180 --> 02:40:39.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And we have no way of knowing.

asr-002605
02:40:42.420 --> 02:40:45.360
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Tapos, ililipat nyo yung pondo sa ibang proyekto,

asr-002606
02:40:47.040 --> 02:40:49.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: tapos i-augment natin kasi na-declare na natin na saving.

asr-002607
02:40:51.540 --> 02:40:52.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Aren't we already,

asr-002608
02:40:52.860 --> 02:40:55.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: bastardizing the GAA?

asr-002609
02:40:57.660 --> 02:41:01.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, based on, well, existing, well,

asr-002610
02:41:01.800 --> 02:41:03.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: existing guidelines,

asr-002611
02:41:04.540 --> 02:41:09.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and also as prescribed by EO 292, Section 51,

asr-002612
02:41:10.520 --> 02:41:13.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it would be the head of agency.

asr-002613
02:41:14.700 --> 02:41:17.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Maybe partly the rationale for that is because

asr-002614
02:41:17.040 --> 02:41:19.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: they would know whether or not,

asr-002615
02:41:19.940 --> 02:41:21.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: they had the technical expertise,

asr-002616
02:41:21.480 --> 02:41:22.360
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: and they have all of the technical knowledge.

asr-002617
02:41:22.360 --> 02:41:22.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But they should,

asr-002618
02:41:22.720 --> 02:41:22.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: they should talk to the director, right?

asr-002619
02:41:22.840 --> 02:41:26.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But we should have a system of checks and balances.

asr-002620
02:41:29.480 --> 02:41:34.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Because if we will say that it is not our obligation to double check,

asr-002621
02:41:35.020 --> 02:41:37.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: then any agency can do this arbitrarily.

asr-002622
02:41:43.460 --> 02:41:48.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Then whatever is passed in the GAA na pinasapu natin ng Kongreso,

asr-002623
02:41:48.700 --> 02:41:49.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: pwedeng palit-palitan na lang.

asr-002624
02:41:49.940 --> 02:41:52.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002625
02:41:52.900 --> 02:41:58.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: We recognize the, and we also, we're one with the concerns of the Honorable Nazal.

asr-002626
02:41:59.300 --> 02:42:01.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Particularly with EO 292,

asr-002627
02:42:03.000 --> 02:42:06.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: well, the DBM submits to the wisdom of Congress.

asr-002628
02:42:06.700 --> 02:42:12.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So we can amend this actually so that we put safeguards in place.

asr-002629
02:42:12.640 --> 02:42:19.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: What safeguards can DBM introduce para po masigurado na hindi po mangyayari?

asr-002631
02:42:42.420 --> 02:42:46.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Well, at least on the part of the DBM,

asr-002632
02:42:47.400 --> 02:42:49.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the DBM assures this,

asr-002633
02:42:49.940 --> 02:42:58.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: this chamber that it has been stringently abiding by all of the laws,

asr-002634
02:42:58.760 --> 02:43:03.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: all of those prescribed by Supreme Court decisions and all existing laws.

asr-002635
02:43:03.400 --> 02:43:07.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But particularly with this, the treatment of savings,

asr-002636
02:43:08.520 --> 02:43:13.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the treatment of certifications for particular projects,

asr-002637
02:43:14.720 --> 02:43:19.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the DBM submits to further amendments to the law.

asr-002638
02:43:19.940 --> 02:43:22.040
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As is relevant.

asr-002639
02:43:22.380 --> 02:43:28.940
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Can you please submit a list kung ano po yung mga project na sinertify,

asr-002640
02:43:29.900 --> 02:43:33.300
Rep. Roberto Nazal: tapos diniklare natin as savings, saan po napunta?

asr-002641
02:43:33.880 --> 02:43:37.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Saan, ano po yung mga augmentation na pinuntahan

asr-002642
02:43:37.540 --> 02:43:40.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ng mga pondo na diniklare natin as savings?

asr-002643
02:43:41.560 --> 02:43:43.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, we will submit, Madam Speaker.

asr-002644
02:43:44.520 --> 02:43:44.840
Rep. Roberto Nazal: When?

asr-002645
02:43:49.940 --> 02:44:00.840
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The DBM commits Thursday, Madam Speaker.

asr-002646
02:44:01.120 --> 02:44:02.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Kasi Wednesday na daw po.

asr-002647
02:44:03.900 --> 02:44:04.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thursday?

asr-002648
02:44:05.060 --> 02:44:05.660
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thursday.

asr-002649
02:44:06.200 --> 02:44:08.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So tomorrow, Madam Speaker.

asr-002650
02:44:08.720 --> 02:44:09.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you for that.

asr-002651
02:44:10.740 --> 02:44:12.520
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Sek ha, we will expect that.

asr-002652
02:44:14.520 --> 02:44:18.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: And may I go to my next question, Madam Chair?

asr-002653
02:44:18.480 --> 02:44:21.700
Rep. Roberto Nazal: After we have everything we have just discussed

asr-002654
02:44:21.700 --> 02:44:24.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: about return sa ROS savings and augmentation,

asr-002655
02:44:26.180 --> 02:44:29.800
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ang tanong ko po, bakit wala po sa 2027 NEP

asr-002656
02:44:29.800 --> 02:44:32.200
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ang chapter on overall savings?

asr-002657
02:44:33.020 --> 02:44:35.100
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Dati po, hanggang 2023,

asr-002658
02:44:36.200 --> 02:44:39.260
Rep. Roberto Nazal: for many years, the NEP showed overall savings,

asr-002659
02:44:39.740 --> 02:44:42.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: how much savings were generated and where they went.

asr-002660
02:44:43.060 --> 02:44:45.720
Rep. Roberto Nazal: It reappeared in 2022 and 2023,

asr-002661
02:44:46.220 --> 02:44:47.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: and then disappeared again.

asr-002662
02:44:47.960 --> 02:44:48.440
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Why?

asr-002663
02:44:48.480 --> 02:44:52.380
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As per the DBM, Madam Speaker,

asr-002664
02:44:52.820 --> 02:44:57.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: that's not allowed, the pooling of overall savings.

asr-002665
02:44:58.760 --> 02:44:59.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Existing laws...

asr-002666
02:45:00.000 --> 02:45:05.280
Rep. Roberto Nazal: But we should have all the data available to us.

asr-002667
02:45:05.280 --> 02:45:13.680
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi po pwedeng dapat, meron, dati nire-reflect natin sa report, tapos kung kailan lang natin gusto i-reflect, doon lang natin i-re-reflect.

asr-002668
02:45:24.260 --> 02:45:28.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So ang sinasabi ko po, dapat consistent po tayo.

asr-002669
02:45:28.160 --> 02:45:37.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So this is information that is vital to us making a decision for Congress to be able to pass the GAA.

asr-002670
02:45:38.840 --> 02:45:42.380
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So ano yung mga savings, yung overall savings ng lahat ng departments?

asr-002671
02:45:42.860 --> 02:45:45.560
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Dati nire-reflect po natin yung to and from.

asr-002672
02:45:47.160 --> 02:45:47.880
Rep. Roberto Nazal: We need that.

asr-002673
02:45:50.700 --> 02:45:51.640
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pwede po bang ibalik?

asr-002674
02:45:58.160 --> 02:46:13.500
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, particularly with overall savings, the establishment of overall savings, apparently that is under the Bayanihan Law, which allowed the pooling of overall savings.

asr-002675
02:46:13.700 --> 02:46:16.680
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But in general, that's not allowed.

asr-002676
02:46:18.160 --> 02:46:21.480
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang sinasabi, ang hinihingi lang naman po natin, yung dating nire-report natin.

asr-002677
02:46:21.480 --> 02:46:24.260
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Chair would like to remind Representative Nazal that his time has already expired.

asr-002678
02:46:24.260 --> 02:46:25.540
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yes, Madam Chair.

asr-002679
02:46:25.940 --> 02:46:28.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ang hinihingi lang, kailangan lang po natin i-clarify.

asr-002680
02:46:28.160 --> 02:46:30.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi hindi pa nila nasasagot yung tanong.

asr-002681
02:46:30.820 --> 02:46:34.820
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, ang hinihingi lang po natin is yung report.

asr-002682
02:46:34.940 --> 02:46:36.040
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Dati naman nire-report.

asr-002683
02:46:36.680 --> 02:46:37.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pwede po ba natin ibalik?

asr-002684
02:46:38.220 --> 02:46:42.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kasi because this is vital to us making a decision.

asr-002685
02:46:43.320 --> 02:46:45.160
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bakit natin tinatago ngayon?

asr-002686
02:46:46.240 --> 02:46:48.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Pwede naman yan i-reflect sa NEP?

asr-002687
02:46:53.000 --> 02:46:57.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The DBM, Madam Speaker, will submit.

asr-002688
02:46:57.500 --> 02:46:58.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's committed to submission.

asr-002689
02:46:58.160 --> 02:46:59.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's committed to submit this report.

asr-002690
02:47:00.100 --> 02:47:02.300
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: However, it's not part of the NEP.

asr-002691
02:47:03.740 --> 02:47:09.860
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kaya nga po, baka pwedeng isama na sa NEP every year sa submission ng NEP.

asr-002692
02:47:12.100 --> 02:47:14.180
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Dati namang meron, binabalik lang natin.

asr-002694
02:47:31.360 --> 02:47:33.920
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Up to 2023, meron namang po tayo niyan.

asr-002695
02:47:42.500 --> 02:47:46.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Okay.

asr-002696
02:47:48.540 --> 02:47:58.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The DBM will study, but as of now, the stand is that the DBM can't create a...

asr-002697
02:47:58.160 --> 02:47:59.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: chapter on overall savings.

asr-002698
02:47:59.660 --> 02:48:01.720
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, we do not have that information?

asr-002699
02:48:07.480 --> 02:48:08.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The DBM will study.

asr-002700
02:48:09.040 --> 02:48:10.120
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Will assess.

asr-002701
02:48:10.740 --> 02:48:12.860
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But there is a report.

asr-002702
02:48:13.460 --> 02:48:18.480
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: And the DBM will publish a copy to the Honorable Nazal.

asr-002703
02:48:19.140 --> 02:48:23.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: That is a very simple report which was included up to 2023.

asr-002704
02:48:23.600 --> 02:48:27.220
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yan yung chapter on overall savings.

asr-002705
02:48:28.160 --> 02:48:31.080
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, yun lang po ang hinihingi natin na i-restore natin yun.

asr-002706
02:48:31.160 --> 02:48:31.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Ibalik natin.

asr-002707
02:48:32.740 --> 02:48:34.600
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Will the DBM submit to that?

asr-002708
02:48:35.980 --> 02:48:39.780
Rep. Roberto Nazal: This is vital information that should be shared with Congress every time.

asr-002709
02:48:47.040 --> 02:48:51.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi ko maintindihan bakit kailangan natin pag-isipan pa.

asr-002710
02:48:51.980 --> 02:48:53.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Okay.

asr-002711
02:48:58.160 --> 02:49:03.240
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The DBM will study, yes.

asr-002712
02:49:04.240 --> 02:49:06.440
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Will study or comply?

asr-002713
02:49:07.940 --> 02:49:11.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: No, ah, well...

asr-002714
02:49:35.500 --> 02:49:56.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Napakahira po bang i-share yung information?

asr-002715
02:49:56.400 --> 02:49:58.120
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kung ano yung savings?

asr-002717
02:49:58.120 --> 02:50:01.620
Rep. Roberto Nazal: ng bawat ahensya at saan in-augment yung pondo na ito?

asr-002718
02:50:05.500 --> 02:50:07.140
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Is it that difficult?

asr-002719
02:50:07.140 --> 02:50:11.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Just to summarize and to clarify, Madam Speaker.

asr-002720
02:50:11.800 --> 02:50:21.960
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The reason why there was a chapter on overall savings in the 2023 NEP is because it was prescribed under Bayanihan Law.

asr-002721
02:50:22.960 --> 02:50:26.440
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, that's the only reason why it was there as a chapter.

asr-002722
02:50:26.440 --> 02:50:26.560
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Okay.

asr-002723
02:50:27.120 --> 02:50:27.920
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: But...

asr-002724
02:50:27.920 --> 02:50:30.020
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: That's because it's prescribed by the Bayanihan Law.

asr-002725
02:50:30.200 --> 02:50:33.340
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, that could be...

asr-002726
02:50:33.340 --> 02:50:40.400
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Even before Bayanihan, Madam Sponsor, meron pong reports on overall savings.

asr-002727
02:50:40.960 --> 02:50:41.740
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Yung to and from.

asr-002728
02:50:42.620 --> 02:50:46.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Kung saan, saan, saan nang galing, saan pumunta.

asr-002729
02:50:47.260 --> 02:50:48.240
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Meron tayong report niyan.

asr-002730
02:50:48.500 --> 02:50:50.500
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Hindi lang after, hindi lang during Bayanihan.

asr-002731
02:50:51.240 --> 02:50:52.980
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Bayanihan was 2021, ha?

asr-002732
02:50:53.980 --> 02:50:57.900
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: The Chair would like to respectfully remind Representative Nazal that his...

asr-002733
02:50:57.900 --> 02:51:00.020
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: his time has already expired to interpolate.

asr-002734
02:51:03.120 --> 02:51:06.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: So, can I just ask for a report on the savings?

asr-002735
02:51:06.720 --> 02:51:06.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes.

asr-002736
02:51:07.500 --> 02:51:08.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002737
02:51:09.400 --> 02:51:10.580
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-002738
02:51:10.780 --> 02:51:12.320
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Madam Sponsor.

asr-002739
02:51:12.320 --> 02:51:14.060
Rep. Roberto Nazal: Thank you, Majority Leader.

asr-002740
02:51:15.940 --> 02:51:24.740
Floor Leader: Madam Speaker, I move to recognize Representative JC M. Abalos for his interpellation.

asr-002741
02:51:25.210 --> 02:51:27.880
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative JC Abalos from 4Ps Party-list

asr-002742
02:51:27.900 --> 02:51:29.960
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: is now recognized for his interpellation.

asr-002743
02:51:32.600 --> 02:51:35.660
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor,

asr-002744
02:51:36.280 --> 02:51:42.960
Rep. JC M. Abalos: sa ahensya ng DBM at sa kanyang mga attached agency sa pangunguna ni Secretary Kim De Leon,

asr-002745
02:51:43.120 --> 02:51:45.000
Rep. JC M. Abalos: magandang umaga po.

asr-002746
02:51:45.820 --> 02:51:47.800
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Dahil inabot na po tayo ng madaling araw,

asr-002747
02:51:47.900 --> 02:51:50.740
Rep. JC M. Abalos: dadiretso na po ako, Madam Speaker, sa aking mga katanungan

asr-002748
02:51:50.740 --> 02:51:57.760
Rep. JC M. Abalos: at nakatoon po ito sa budget ng 4P's program for year 2027.

asr-002749
02:51:57.900 --> 02:51:59.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, for the record po, Madam Speaker,

asr-002750
02:52:00.420 --> 02:52:06.900
Rep. JC M. Abalos: pwede po ba namin malaman kung ano ang proposed budget allocation para sa 4P's for year 2027?

asr-002751
02:52:07.680 --> 02:52:13.600
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At pwede po bang i-confirm ng ating sponsor na nabawasan po ang pondong ito

asr-002752
02:52:13.600 --> 02:52:18.340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: from around 113 billion last year to 99 billion?

asr-002753
02:52:27.900 --> 02:52:45.640
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Madam Speaker, for 2027, under the 2027 NEP,

asr-002754
02:52:45.820 --> 02:52:48.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the allocation would be 99 billion.

asr-002755
02:52:48.520 --> 02:52:55.140
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The decrease as per the DBM would be attributed to a decrease in the number of beneficiaries.

asr-002756
02:52:55.620 --> 02:52:57.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Because fortunately,

asr-002757
02:52:57.900 --> 02:53:00.760
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: At least some of them have graduated from the four-piece program.

asr-002758
02:53:01.480 --> 02:53:06.420
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, to confirm po, Madam Speaker, ayon po ba sa ating distinguished sponsor pati sa DBM,

asr-002759
02:53:06.980 --> 02:53:15.620
Rep. JC M. Abalos: ang primary driver sa budget decrease ay ang changes in the number of beneficiary households.

asr-002760
02:53:15.740 --> 02:53:16.540
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Can we get a confirmation?

asr-002761
02:53:17.880 --> 02:53:18.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002762
02:53:18.820 --> 02:53:26.540
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And is it true po, Madam Speaker, that for many years, government maintained a target of approximately 4.4 million households

asr-002763
02:53:26.540 --> 02:53:34.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: and now we understand that the number of households is being brought down to 3.5 million.

asr-002764
02:53:35.040 --> 02:53:40.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, gusto ko po malaman, Madam Speaker, kung ano yung empirical basis para sa 3.5 million figure.

asr-002765
02:53:40.280 --> 02:53:49.900
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Is it based on PSA poverty statistics, CBMS data, proxy means test, projected graduation of existing beneficiaries?

asr-002766
02:53:50.420 --> 02:53:56.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Ano po ba ang empirical basis at ang primary driver kung bakit po natin pinababa to 3.5 million?

asr-002767
02:53:56.540 --> 02:54:01.700
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: I guess, Madam Speaker, that is correct.

asr-002768
02:54:02.040 --> 02:54:06.820
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, from 4.4 million households, now it's at 3.5 million.

asr-002769
02:54:07.580 --> 02:54:18.620
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: The 3.5 million level is from the most updated version of the listahanan, from the DSWD, Madam Speaker.

asr-002770
02:54:19.580 --> 02:54:25.240
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Madam Speaker, kanina nung pinapag-usapan po natin ang budget ng DepDev, binanggit ko po ang CBMS.

asr-002772
02:54:26.540 --> 02:54:35.820
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, was the DBM informed na hindi na po natin ginagamit ng listahanan mula nung nagkaroon na po tayo ng CBMS?

asr-002773
02:54:36.240 --> 02:54:47.520
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, sinasabi po ba ng ating distinguished sponsor na ang batayan ng 3.5 million households ay nakabatay pa rin sa listahanan na isinagawa nung nakalipas ng ilang taon na po?

asr-002774
02:54:47.700 --> 02:54:50.940
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Lumang datos na po yun. CBMS na po tayo ngayon, Madam Speaker.

asr-002775
02:54:50.940 --> 02:54:56.180
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the DBM, Madam Speaker,

asr-002776
02:54:56.540 --> 02:55:03.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: we're still using listahanan, but now there's a feedback mechanism with the CBMS.

asr-002777
02:55:04.020 --> 02:55:14.540
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Once it's fully rolled out, well, it's already fully rolled out, but now we're matching between the listahanan and the...

asr-002778
02:55:15.820 --> 02:55:21.920
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Okay. So, Madam Speaker, para lang po malinaw, habang nandito pa po ang mga kasamahan natin mula sa DepDev,

asr-002779
02:55:21.920 --> 02:55:24.120
Rep. JC M. Abalos: pwede rin silang kausapin ng DBM kung gusto nila.

asr-002780
02:55:24.620 --> 02:55:25.920
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Sa aking pagkakaintindi, meron po tayong...

asr-002781
02:55:26.540 --> 02:55:30.020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: around 3 million active households under the 4-piece program.

asr-002782
02:55:30.160 --> 02:55:36.560
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Meron ba tayong breakdown sa 3 million na ito kung ilan dyan ang galing sa listahanan at ilan dyan ang nanggaling sa CBMS?

asr-002783
02:55:38.380 --> 02:55:46.460
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And could the DBM also confirm, ayon po sa DSWD mismo, may higit 100,000 households tayo subject to validation

asr-002784
02:55:46.460 --> 02:55:52.060
Rep. JC M. Abalos: dahil may mga pamilya na hindi mahanap sa CBMS na nasa listahanan dati.

asr-002785
02:55:52.060 --> 02:55:55.980
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, pwede po ba tayong magkaroon ng kalinawan mula sa DBM?

asr-002786
02:55:55.980 --> 02:56:08.460
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kung paano tayo nag-come up with a new number of household beneficiary targets while at the same time considering na hindi na po listahanan ang ginagamit ngayon, CBMS na po.

asr-002787
02:56:09.480 --> 02:56:16.640
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At as a matter of fact, nabanggit ko rin po kanina, 5 bilyong piso ang inilaan natin noong 2024 for the CBMS.

asr-002788
02:56:17.180 --> 02:56:24.020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Sinabi rin po mismo ng DepDev kanina na kompleto na ang kanilang pag-turnover as of this year.

asr-002789
02:56:24.020 --> 02:56:25.820
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At hanggang ngayon, hindi pa rin po yun ang ginagamit.

asr-002790
02:56:25.980 --> 02:56:30.160
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And next year, bibigyan na naman natin ng panibagong 5 bilyon.

asr-002791
02:56:30.520 --> 02:56:33.900
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, ano po talaga? Ano yung breakdown ng active household beneficiaries?

asr-002792
02:56:34.120 --> 02:56:36.520
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Ilan yung galing sa listahanan? Ilan yung galing sa CBMS?

asr-002793
02:56:38.740 --> 02:56:43.180
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And Madam Speaker, gusto ko po ulit malaman, ano yung empirical basis?

asr-002794
02:56:43.880 --> 02:56:49.160
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Poverty statistics ba? Proxy means test ba? Pwede ko po ba malaman, Madam Speaker?

asr-002795
02:56:55.980 --> 02:57:07.020
Rep. JC M. Abalos: And habang inaabangan ko po ang sagot ng ating distinguished sponsor,

asr-002796
02:57:07.920 --> 02:57:12.960
Rep. JC M. Abalos: gusto ko pong malaman kung sino ang nag-determine ng 3.5 million target.

asr-002797
02:57:13.640 --> 02:57:18.320
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Rinekomenda po ba ito ng DSWD, ng DepDev, o ng DBM?

asr-002798
02:57:20.320 --> 02:57:21.880
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Thank you, Madam Speaker.

asr-002800
02:57:21.980 --> 02:57:30.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: There's an ongoing reconciliation between the listahanan and the CBMS.

asr-002801
02:57:33.320 --> 02:57:36.660
Rep. JC M. Abalos: How long has the reconciliation been going on for?

asr-002802
02:57:36.980 --> 02:57:40.480
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Considering that the CBMS Act was enacted in 2019,

asr-002803
02:57:41.080 --> 02:57:44.540
Rep. JC M. Abalos: and we conducted a population census in 2024,

asr-002804
02:57:44.540 --> 02:57:50.600
Rep. JC M. Abalos: and we're about to allot another 5 billion peso budget for the CBMS for next year.

asr-002805
02:57:50.800 --> 02:57:51.560
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Okay.

asr-002806
02:57:51.980 --> 02:58:02.580
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Sa totoo lang po, Madam Speaker, ang dami pong pamilya na naka-waitlist sa 4Ps.

asr-002807
02:58:03.140 --> 02:58:08.520
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At sinasabi ko po na napakahalaga po nito dahil ayon po sa pagsusuri ng PIDS,

asr-002808
02:58:09.400 --> 02:58:17.040
Rep. JC M. Abalos: hindi pa po factored in ang Middle East oil crisis kung titignan natin ang ating poverty incidence rate ngayon.

asr-002809
02:58:17.380 --> 02:58:21.860
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Sabi po nila 9.8%, pero naputunayan natin kanina,

asr-002810
02:58:21.980 --> 02:58:30.800
Rep. JC M. Abalos: na yung data collection natin hindi naman siya isinagawa in a consistent basis.

asr-002811
02:58:30.940 --> 02:58:32.700
Rep. JC M. Abalos: In transit siya isinagawa.

asr-002812
02:58:32.900 --> 02:58:38.580
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At dahil po dyan, may mga pag-aaral na maaaring magkaroon ng karagdagang 1.34 billion households

asr-002813
02:58:38.580 --> 02:58:40.900
Rep. JC M. Abalos: na magiging poor or near poor dahil sa crisis.

asr-002814
02:58:41.480 --> 02:58:44.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So gusto ko po malaman, gano'n nakatagal yung reconciliation?

asr-002815
02:58:44.700 --> 02:58:50.910
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Considering na we already allotted 5 billion for the CBMS in 2024,

asr-002816
02:58:50.910 --> 02:58:54.180
Rep. JC M. Abalos: and we're about to allot another 5 billion next year.

asr-002819
02:58:54.180 --> 02:58:55.520
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Yes, Madam Speaker.

asr-002820
02:58:55.980 --> 02:58:59.320
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: With regards to the 3.5 million level,

asr-002821
02:59:00.000 --> 02:59:04.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: the DBM defers to the DSWD with regards to that number.

asr-002822
02:59:05.240 --> 02:59:15.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So with the technical details of how the 3.5 million level was arrived at,

asr-002823
02:59:15.280 --> 02:59:20.160
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: that would be better answered by the DSWD.

asr-002824
02:59:20.160 --> 02:59:29.600
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: However, at least the goal is that actually there won't be a Listahanan 4 anymore

asr-002825
02:59:29.600 --> 02:59:32.200
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: kasi na-roll out na yung CBMS.

asr-002826
02:59:33.200 --> 02:59:38.300
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So the reconciliation is still ongoing, but given that...

asr-002827
02:59:38.300 --> 02:59:41.320
Rep. JC M. Abalos: For how many years, Madam Speaker, has the reconciliation been ongoing?

asr-002828
02:59:42.020 --> 02:59:45.000
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kailan po natin kinonsider na outdated na ang listahanan?

asr-002830
02:59:50.160 --> 02:59:57.220
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At ilang pamilya pa ba ang vina-validate natin from listahanan to CBMS

asr-002831
02:59:57.220 --> 02:59:59.000
Rep. JC M. Abalos: noong nag-transition na tayo to CBMS?

asr-002833
03:00:00.000 --> 03:00:03.820
Rep. JC M. Abalos: How many households are still in limbo? Can we find out the number?

asr-002834
03:00:04.560 --> 03:00:13.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: Unfortunately, Madam Speaker, the DBM doesn't have details with regards to how long this reconciliation has been taking place.

asr-002835
03:00:19.220 --> 03:00:23.460
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: It's the SWD who would have details on it, Madam Speaker.

asr-002836
03:00:23.460 --> 03:00:34.680
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, does the DBM mean to tell us, Madam Speaker, that when we allotted P99 billion for this program,

asr-002837
03:00:35.820 --> 03:00:44.120
Rep. JC M. Abalos: hindi pa po natin na-reconcile ang listahan ng mga prospective beneficiaries, considering na ang dami pang naka-waitlist?

asr-002838
03:00:48.500 --> 03:00:53.080
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the DBM, Madam Speaker, they really defer to the

asr-002839
03:00:53.080 --> 03:00:58.400
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: DSWD with regards to the number of households, as for the level.

asr-002840
03:00:58.740 --> 03:01:07.780
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, the 3.5 million really was determined by the DSWD, and DBM just considered that for the budget allocation of the four-piece program.

asr-002841
03:01:07.780 --> 03:01:19.540
Rep. JC M. Abalos: For purposes of allotting budget allocations, does the DBM defer to the DSWD or the CBMS data that was supposed to be furnished by the PSA?

asr-002842
03:01:23.460 --> 03:01:39.980
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: As for the DBM, Madam Speaker, it's an implementing agency who would give the level.

asr-002843
03:01:40.240 --> 03:01:48.360
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, particularly for the four-piece program, since it's the DSWD, it would be the DSW that gives.

asr-002844
03:01:49.200 --> 03:01:52.900
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: So, regardless of the source of the data or what the basis is,

asr-002845
03:01:53.460 --> 03:01:56.280
Rep. Bella Vanessa B. Suansing: it really is the agency proposal.

asr-002846
03:01:56.280 --> 03:02:03.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: For the information of the DBM as well as its attached agencies,

asr-002847
03:02:05.000 --> 03:02:10.220
Rep. JC M. Abalos: ayon po sa four-piece law, naka-based po sa National Standardized Targeting System.

asr-002848
03:02:10.660 --> 03:02:15.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: It used to be listahanan, that's correct, at ngayon umaasa na po tayo sa CBMS.

asr-002849
03:02:16.540 --> 03:02:20.680
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At gusto ko lang po malaman, and the DBM can furnish this to us later on,

asr-002850
03:02:21.040 --> 03:02:23.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: whether it be the DBM or the...

asr-002851
03:02:23.460 --> 03:02:34.080
Rep. JC M. Abalos: DepDev, gusto ko lang po malaman sana what happens today if a household was once identified as poor under listahanan 3,

asr-002852
03:02:34.500 --> 03:02:40.220
Rep. JC M. Abalos: so otherwise qualified for four-piece, waitlisted because there was no available slot,

asr-002853
03:02:41.000 --> 03:02:45.620
Rep. JC M. Abalos: but now cannot be located or matched in the CBMS.

asr-002854
03:02:46.340 --> 03:02:53.340
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Gusto ko lang po malaman from any of our agencies concerned kung meron bang mechanism allowing a family

asr-002855
03:02:53.460 --> 03:02:59.040
Rep. JC M. Abalos: to request inclusion, re-enumeration, or independent value validation,

asr-002856
03:02:59.500 --> 03:03:03.460
Rep. JC M. Abalos: especially if the NEP budget assumes a reduced caseload,

asr-002857
03:03:04.360 --> 03:03:06.260
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kasi based on the budget that we have now.

asr-002858
03:03:06.780 --> 03:03:11.480
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Kaya siya bumaba from 113 billion to 99 billion, at sinabi po ito ng ating sponsor,

asr-002859
03:03:11.960 --> 03:03:13.720
Rep. JC M. Abalos: meron po tayong reduced caseload.

asr-002860
03:03:14.260 --> 03:03:19.460
Rep. JC M. Abalos: At nabanggit rin po kanina na may mga pamilya pa po tayo ng four-piece subject to revalidation,

asr-002861
03:03:19.620 --> 03:03:22.460
Rep. JC M. Abalos: kasi nag-transition tayo from listahanan to CBMS.

asr-002862
03:03:23.460 --> 03:03:29.140
Rep. JC M. Abalos: So, dahil mag-umaga na, i-request ko na lang po sa ating DBM, pati sa ating sponsor,

asr-002863
03:03:29.260 --> 03:03:36.460
Rep. JC M. Abalos: na baka pwede po tayo i-furnish ng mechanism na kanilang ginagamit pagdating po sa programa ng four-piece.

asr-002864
03:03:37.280 --> 03:03:42.280
Rep. JC M. Abalos: Yun lamang po, Madam Speaker, Distinguished Sponsor, maraming salamat at magandang gabi po.

asr-002865
03:03:43.040 --> 03:03:43.340
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Thank you.

asr-002866
03:03:43.360 --> 03:03:43.880
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Leader.

asr-002867
03:03:49.820 --> 03:03:53.420
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: Madam Speaker, I move that we recognize the honor,

asr-002868
03:03:53.460 --> 03:03:55.820
Rep. Rhea Mae A. Gullas: the Honorable Antonio Tineo for his interpellation.

asr-002869
03:03:56.200 --> 03:04:02.080
Deputy Speaker Mercedes K. Alvarez: Representative Antonio Tineo of ACT Teachers Party, this is now recognized for his interpellation.

asr-002870
03:04:03.180 --> 03:04:04.160
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-002871
03:04:05.320 --> 03:04:06.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Last na po yata.

asr-002872
03:04:07.120 --> 03:04:16.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: So, anyway, again, meron tayong, balik tayo dun sa presentation.

asr-002873
03:04:17.640 --> 03:04:19.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tutal, andito na si Secretary Kim.

asr-002874
03:04:22.140 --> 03:04:23.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Importante po ito.

asr-002875
03:04:23.460 --> 03:04:24.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Na marinig niya.

asr-002876
03:04:25.560 --> 03:04:25.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay.

asr-002877
03:04:30.580 --> 03:04:31.020
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Presentation.

asr-002878
03:04:31.120 --> 03:04:31.220
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ako.

asr-002879
03:04:32.800 --> 03:04:33.820
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Paki-pause po muna.

asr-002880
03:04:33.980 --> 03:04:34.460
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Wala pa eh.

asr-002885
03:05:41.820 --> 03:05:42.200
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Thank you.

asr-002886
03:05:43.040 --> 03:05:44.880
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Alright, so here we go again.

asr-002887
03:05:48.200 --> 03:05:48.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Again,

asr-002888
03:05:49.200 --> 03:05:50.640
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I showed this earlier.

asr-002889
03:05:50.640 --> 03:05:52.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ito po yung 10-year

asr-002890
03:05:52.560 --> 03:05:54.960
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: history ng

asr-002891
03:05:54.960 --> 03:05:55.940
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: MPBF.

asr-002892
03:05:57.660 --> 03:05:58.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: As I

asr-002893
03:05:58.800 --> 03:05:59.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: pointed out earlier,

asr-002894
03:06:00.940 --> 03:06:04.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: especially under the

asr-002895
03:06:04.420 --> 03:06:06.580
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Marcos administration, this administration

asr-002896
03:06:06.580 --> 03:06:08.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: naging paboritong target po

asr-002897
03:06:08.760 --> 03:06:09.300
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ito ng

asr-002898
03:06:09.300 --> 03:06:13.740
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: reduction.

asr-002899
03:06:15.060 --> 03:06:15.420
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Tapos,

asr-002900
03:06:16.080 --> 03:06:17.860
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ginagamit daw na source.

asr-002901
03:06:17.860 --> 03:06:19.760
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Source of funding

asr-002902
03:06:19.760 --> 03:06:21.800
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: for congressional

asr-002903
03:06:21.800 --> 03:06:22.540
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: insertion.

asr-002904
03:06:22.560 --> 03:06:24.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Very clearly,

asr-002905
03:06:24.560 --> 03:06:26.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: especially in the years

asr-002906
03:06:26.560 --> 03:06:27.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 2023,

asr-002907
03:06:27.560 --> 03:06:28.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 24,

asr-002908
03:06:28.560 --> 03:06:29.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 25,

asr-002909
03:06:29.560 --> 03:06:30.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 26.

asr-002910
03:06:30.560 --> 03:06:31.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ngayon,

asr-002911
03:06:31.560 --> 03:06:32.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: so,

asr-002912
03:06:32.560 --> 03:06:34.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: my purpose here is to

asr-002913
03:06:34.560 --> 03:06:36.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: point this out and call it out.

asr-002914
03:06:36.560 --> 03:06:42.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Dapat itigil na yung ganyang modus.

asr-002915
03:06:42.560 --> 03:06:46.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: In the same way na dapat hindi na rin gawin yan

asr-002916
03:06:46.560 --> 03:06:50.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: sa DOTR Foreign Assisted Project

asr-002917
03:06:50.560 --> 03:06:52.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: and other foreign assisted projects.

asr-002918
03:06:52.560 --> 03:07:02.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: But, now my question to the DBM is, yun nga, with regard to the MPBF, proposed MPBF for 2027,

asr-002919
03:07:02.560 --> 03:07:07.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: amounting to 55 billion, no?

asr-002920
03:07:07.560 --> 03:07:10.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: I raised it during the budget briefing pero,

asr-002921
03:07:10.560 --> 03:07:20.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: hindi po ba, please confirm, na kasama po sa proposal nyo, yung plano na finally, after,

asr-002922
03:07:20.560 --> 03:07:25.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: after,

asr-002923
03:07:25.560 --> 03:07:27.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: 17 years,

asr-002924
03:07:27.560 --> 03:07:30.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: since 2009,

asr-002925
03:07:30.560 --> 03:07:31.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ay,

asr-002926
03:07:31.560 --> 03:07:33.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: magkakaroon na ng increase sa

asr-002927
03:07:33.560 --> 03:07:36.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: personnel economic relief allowance.

asr-002928
03:07:36.560 --> 03:07:41.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Yung 2,000 a month na

asr-002929
03:07:41.560 --> 03:07:43.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: allowance,

asr-002930
03:07:43.560 --> 03:07:48.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: like a cost of living allowance for all government personnel.

asr-002931
03:07:48.560 --> 03:07:49.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Hindi ba, about time,

asr-002932
03:07:49.560 --> 03:07:51.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: dapat na pong taasan ito.

asr-002933
03:07:51.560 --> 03:07:54.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Considering,

asr-002934
03:07:54.560 --> 03:07:57.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: may economic crisis

asr-002935
03:07:57.560 --> 03:08:00.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: at kailangang matulungan

asr-002936
03:08:00.560 --> 03:08:03.560
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: ang ating mga

asr-002937
03:08:03.560 --> 03:08:06.560
